      "title": null,
      "role": "Software Engineer",
      "location": "Bengaluru",
      "rating": 1.0,
      "pros": "Work culture is kind of average, it's kind of good for people interested in ML jole.",
      "cons": "They hire people for a specific role but end up putting them in a whole other department for example my batchmates n I were hired for backend development but we were put into ML development which turned out to be really stressful and uneasy for us.We were not allowed to change department which contradicted their statement which said department exchange will be done if one is not satisfied with the new role.\nSo I would suggest the company to hire people according to role and not spoil people's careers.",
